In 1796 Edward Jenner, a local doctor in Gloucestershire,
England, became obsessed with milkmaids.

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:13.629
He started observing them, he said it was
for medical research but we’ve all heard

00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:14.629
that one before.

00:00:14.629 --> 00:00:19.480
But after a while he started to notice something
peculiar, all the milkmaids were immune to

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:24.449
smallpox, a highly virulent and common, killer
disease at the time.

00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:29.070
He suspected this was because milkmaids often
contracted the relatively mild disease of

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:35.180
cowpox first, which somehow made them immune
to smallpox.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:40.340
Jenner carried out a famous experiment on
an eight-year-old boy and purposely injected

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.710
him with a small amount of the cowpox virus.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:48.320
As Jenner had hypothesized, the boy was now
immune to smallpox.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:54.530
He was so confident that he even carried out
the experiment on his 11-month-old son.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:01:01.340
Two years later Jenner published his research,
coining the word “vaccine” from the Latin

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.700
“vacca”, meaning cow.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:08.070
Of course, because the Catholic Church were,
as usual, intimidated by Jenner’s progressive

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:13.040
thinking, they launched a smear campaign to
ridicule him and his research.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:18.880
Luckily for millions and millions of lives,
pragmatism eventually prevailed and in 1803

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:23.680
Jenner was awarded government funding as the
usage of vaccines became widespread throughout

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.060
Europe and the US.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:32.100
All was going well for a couple of hundred
years and then in 1998 a former British doctor

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:37.990
and medical researcher called Andrew Wakefield
published a research paper claiming that there

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:43.979
