00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.470
So how does a vaccine work anyway?

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:42.910
Well a vaccine is basically an expansion pack
for our immune system.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:47.750
When harmful microbes enter our body our immune
system kicks into action and releases anti

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:52.660
bodies, little battleships that hunt down
the invading virus or bacteria and exterminate

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:53.660
