00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:06.010
Because every pathogen is different, a different
approach is needed, in order for our immune

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.090
system to deal with each and every one.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:12.400
A vaccine contains either a very small and
safe amount of the actual pathogen which it’s

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:17.400
intended to protect you from or a pathogen
which is already dead.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:21.749
Once the inactive pathogen has been injected
into our body, an immune system response is

00:04:21.749 --> 00:04:27.190
trigged and it learns everything about the
pathogen and remembers it, so if it ever comes

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:32.259
along again, in greater numbers, our immune
system is well-prepared.

00:04:32.259 --> 00:04:38.770
Countless studies have shown that this is
a perfectly safe way to immunize your body

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.539
